e","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ts は生成されないす。","ts":"1615729227.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Cj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b97f091-fc07-4e94-97b6-0de19e6bbee8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ですです。","ts":"1615729220.040200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"isx1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AF1ABF20-9C5B-4CBD-90B8-A452747244B7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そもそもバックエンドだけになるのか多分","ts":"1615729215.040000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7t1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43B80685-8A02-4511-82B5-6AD51A926DFC","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"モノレポになるのかな？","ts":"1615729201.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hds"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ad19047-7dd1-43bc-b7ea-81dc28a95ffd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Go のクライアント生成するかい？って。","ts":"1615729187.039100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"59F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"824aaed9-65ba-49f4-b7b5-812030672fa4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"はい。prisma init の時に聞いてきてくれるんですこれ。","ts":"1615729171.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vNvAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74555fdc-60b2-43dc-b55d-cd7450aa9492","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/prisma/prisma-client-go\u003e\nGo の clientもあるみたいですね。","ts":"1615729057.038300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: prisma/prisma-client-go","id":1,"title":"prisma/prisma-client-go","title_link":"https://github.com/prisma/prisma-client-go","text":"Prisma Client Go is an auto-generated and fully type-safe datab